# steps/table-receiver.md §10: two parts (harness Parts) each declare k at its root -- two Structures of the
# program with no name, one per part -- and the source declares its own k, 1: peekA reads its part's k, 5,
# peekB its own, 8, and the source's code its own, 1.  Entry 7.
size_t: k 1U
size_t: a 0U
size_t: b 0U
a: peekA()
b: peekB()
if: a != 5U
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 81; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
if: b != 8U
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 82; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
if: k != 1U
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 83; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
